{"channelId":"UCa_ewVIBC9YmLJKQGLdXGNA","row":["West Chiropractic",3840,"At West Chiropractic, we exist to help our clients live their best life. Chiropractic clinic in West Byfleet providing care to the community to alleviate back and neck pain. We focus on getting you back to doing what you love, whether it’s sitting comfortably at your desk, playing football, picking up your kids or working out. We understand and will get you there.\n\nOur vision is to set the standard for ethical, client-centric, life-changing chiropractic care. Our core values and the way we behave to demonstrate them serve as the cornerstone of our decision-making process, especially when it comes to hiring the right people to join our valued team. \n\nOur number 1 priority is delivering exceptional customer service that wows our clients. From their first interaction to every subsequent visit, we aim to exceed their expectations at every touchpoint. While administrative tasks are important, nothing trumps the experience our clients receive.","info@westchiropractic.co.uk; addlestone@westchiropractic.co.uk","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa_ewVIBC9YmLJKQGLdXGNA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa_ewVIBC9YmLJKQGLdXGNA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:50:48.522Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa_ewVIBC9YmLJKQGLdXGNA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:50:48.522Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa_ewVIBC9YmLJKQGLdXGNA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3840,"raw":"3.84K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa_ewVIBC9YmLJKQGLdXGNA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:39.065Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@westchiropractic.co.uk","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://westchiropractic.co.uk/","https://westchiropractic.co.uk/about/","https://westchiropracti